				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I recently participated in the Lake Rathetear part of the necro epic (for Sacilia).  It seemed pretty easy.
<br />
I think there were two groups there, no more than 3 (we'd need only two   )
<br />
Th only change I would make to the way she ran it, would be to let the clerics load an undead nuke or dot if they wanted to. (we don't get to use them much hehe)
<br />
All three battles went pretty easily, I think there was one death of a caster from nuking too soon (or some such). 
<br />
You could check with Sacilia for details.
<br />

<br />
But - Anthem could do this easily. IMHO Shaylah Greymist
<br />

<br />
The early bird may get the worm,
<br />
but the second mouse gets the cheese!
<br />
